        <mxCell id="c252" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Ex 16.6, with the table sorted by Orders Approved, largest first; a measure with nothing to count is blank, and the total row adds every approver. Outlined: the Chief Financial Officer&#x27;s orders, 99.92%, and the Accounting Manager&#x27;s registers, 100.00%. Desktop sets the table to the right of the cards and the chart; the mock stacks the three. The page&#x27;s text box is not drawn.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="682" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
